00:01:40.360 --> 00:01:41.760 line:100%
YUNSHAN ZIZHU RESTAURANT

00:01:41.840 --> 00:01:43.120 line:100%
It's cold outside.

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:44.320 line:100%
How about I drive you?

00:01:44.960 --> 00:01:47.720 line:100%
No need. My company is close by.
It's just a short walk.

00:01:48.240 --> 00:01:49.520 line:100%
Go on. Get back to work.

00:01:52.760 --> 00:01:53.600 line:100%
You…

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:07.320 line:100%
So, since that time,

00:02:08.439 --> 00:02:10.080 line:100%
you had been planning to kill Captain Ran?

00:02:15.520 --> 00:02:17.160 line:100%
Quite the opposite.

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:20.440 line:100%
When I discovered that he was a cop,

00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:22.840 line:100%
I actually stopped worrying.

00:02:23.840 --> 00:02:25.000 line:100%
At the time, I thought

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:27.760 line:100%
Qiao Suqing must have been acting.

00:02:28.920 --> 00:02:32.120 line:100%
She wanted to use the cop
as a cover for herself.

00:02:32.800 --> 00:02:35.160 line:100%
She was carrying too many secrets.

00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:39.080 line:100%
How could she possibly be with a cop?

00:02:39.920 --> 00:02:42.520 line:100%
But over the following months,

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:45.320 line:100%
Qiao Suqing clearly became cold toward me.

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:49.080 line:100%
I'd send her messages,
but she rarely replied.

00:02:49.680 --> 00:02:51.600 line:100%
When she answered the phone,
she'd say she was working.

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:54.840 line:100%
She always said she was busy.

00:02:57.040 --> 00:02:57.880 line:100%
She changed.

00:02:58.480 --> 00:03:01.680 line:100%
<i>I couldn't help myself,</i>
<i>so I went back to Weiyang.</i>

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:04.240 line:100%
<i>I wanted to give her a surprise.</i>

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:07.080 line:100%
<i>I wanted to spend</i>
<i>the Chinese New Year with her.</i>

00:03:07.160 --> 00:03:09.560 line:100%
Hello. Please wrap these two up for me.

00:03:10.880 --> 00:03:12.800 line:100%
Do you want to wear it now?
I can take the tags off for you.

00:03:13.480 --> 00:03:15.240 line:100%
Sure. Thanks.

00:03:25.920 --> 00:03:27.000 line:100%
Welcome.

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:51.120 line:100%
<i>I can never forget</i>

00:03:51.640 --> 00:03:54.000 line:100%
<i>the look in her eyes back then.</i>

00:03:55.720 --> 00:03:58.080 line:100%
<i>I had never seen her smile so happily.</i>

00:04:01.360 --> 00:04:03.680 line:100%
I thought about it for two whole days.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:08.400 line:100%
In the end, I decided
I had to go talk to her.

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:11.360 line:100%
She's in great danger now.

00:04:11.440 --> 00:04:13.600 line:100%
I must protect her.

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:18.160 line:100%
But then, right at that moment,

00:04:20.680 --> 00:04:22.960 line:100%
I received a call from her.

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:27.640 line:100%
You're going to turn yourself in?

00:04:29.480 --> 00:04:31.480 line:100%
I've confessed everything to the police.

00:04:33.160 --> 00:04:34.960 line:100%
I'm the one who killed everyone.

00:04:36.160 --> 00:04:37.160 line:100%
Including you.

00:04:39.400 --> 00:04:41.360 line:100%
When do you plan to turn yourself in?

00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:44.000 line:100%
Tomorrow morning.

00:04:48.800 --> 00:04:52.360 line:100%
Why didn't the cop just arrest you?

00:04:52.960 --> 00:04:54.520 line:100%
He promised me

00:04:57.520 --> 00:04:59.720 line:100%
that I could finish
this Chinese New Year's Eve.

00:05:03.960 --> 00:05:05.920 line:100%
I'll come find you right now.

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:06.840 line:100%
I'll stay with you.

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:10.800 line:100%
Meng, don't come.

00:05:12.640 --> 00:05:16.040 line:100%
<i>I already promised that cop</i>
<i>that I wouldn't run.</i>

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:18.240 line:100%
He also promised me

00:05:19.640 --> 00:05:21.000 line:100%
that tonight,

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:24.160 line:100%
he would spend
the Chinese New Year with me.

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:27.400 line:100%
<i>I had made an appointment with him.</i>

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:30.360 line:100%
<i>When I finish my part-time job tonight,</i>

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:32.880 line:100%
<i>he'll come to pick me up.</i>

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:34.760 line:100%
Tomorrow morning,

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:38.400 line:100%
he'll go with me to turn myself in.

00:05:40.880 --> 00:05:41.920 line:100%
<i>Meng,</i>

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:45.920 line:100%
<i>you must live a good life.</i>

00:05:47.320 --> 00:05:49.880 line:100%
Sister, wait for me.

00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:52.680 line:100%
I'm taking the train tomorrow morning
back to Weiyang.

00:05:53.360 --> 00:05:56.040 line:100%
-<i>I'll go with you to turn yourself in.</i>
-No.

00:05:56.800 --> 00:05:57.760 line:100%
Absolutely not.

00:05:57.840 --> 00:06:00.280 line:100%
<i>You finally have a home of your own.</i>

00:06:00.360 --> 00:06:03.320 line:100%
<i>Just stay there and live well.</i>

00:06:04.160 --> 00:06:05.920 line:100%
Live the life you want.

00:07:01.640 --> 00:07:04.320 line:100%
Previously,
when I was tailing Qiao Suqing,

00:07:05.600 --> 00:07:07.560 line:100%
I visited the place
where she worked part-time.

00:07:09.840 --> 00:07:12.200 line:100%
I noticed a section of the road
with a construction site in the middle.

00:07:14.520 --> 00:07:16.600 line:100%
So I thought of using my old method,

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:19.840 line:100%
which was staging an accident.

00:07:21.200 --> 00:07:22.880 line:100%
To ensure success,

00:07:23.680 --> 00:07:25.560 line:100%
I went back to the mall.

00:07:27.160 --> 00:07:28.520 line:100%
I bought a wig,

00:07:29.560 --> 00:07:33.720 line:100%
and I even bought the same Bowls coat
and red scarf as Qiao Suqing.

00:07:34.520 --> 00:07:36.080 line:100%
I dressed up just like her.

00:07:37.240 --> 00:07:38.120 line:100%
First,

00:07:38.200 --> 00:07:41.480 line:100%
it helped me better attract
the attention of that cop.

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:43.040 line:100%
Second,

00:07:44.240 --> 00:07:45.720 line:100%
if the plan failed,

00:07:47.240 --> 00:07:49.240 line:100%
I could still pin the blame on her.

00:07:50.120 --> 00:07:52.400 line:100%
You kept insisting
that you wanted to protect Qiao Suqing.

00:07:52.480 --> 00:07:53.800 line:100%
Why would you try to frame her?

00:07:53.880 --> 00:07:55.040 line:100%
Why do you think!

00:07:56.400 --> 00:07:57.760 line:100%
It was for our safety.

00:07:59.800 --> 00:08:01.360 line:100%
I killed Yao,

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:04.840 line:100%
I killed Xu Zhihong,
and I killed Wu Shanlong.

00:08:07.680 --> 00:08:08.680 line:100%
But what about her?

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:13.920 line:100%
She knew clearly that the cop
was investigating us,

00:08:15.040 --> 00:08:16.520 line:100%
yet she still stayed with him.

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:19.360 line:100%
She lied to me.

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:20.920 line:100%
She betrayed me.

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:22.320 line:100%
She deserves it.

00:08:22.400 --> 00:08:23.800 line:100%
She deserves it!

00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:52.480 line:100%
SIR

00:09:02.440 --> 00:09:03.680 line:100%
Qiao.

00:09:05.280 --> 00:09:06.440 line:100%
Qiao, no!

00:10:00.720 --> 00:10:03.320 line:100%
SIR

00:10:54.200 --> 00:10:55.080 line:100%
Xu…

00:11:20.880 --> 00:11:23.720 line:100%
I should have killed Ran long ago.

00:11:25.720 --> 00:11:29.760 line:100%
If not for him,
Qiao Suqing would never have betrayed me.

00:11:30.280 --> 00:11:32.600 line:100%
She would still be my elder sister,

00:11:32.680 --> 00:11:34.600 line:100%
and I would still be her younger sister.

00:11:34.680 --> 00:11:37.640 line:100%
We could have lived happily

00:11:39.240 --> 00:11:41.320 line:100%
at home together.

00:11:41.400 --> 00:11:43.160 line:100%
Xu Meng, you're not human!

00:11:43.240 --> 00:11:45.160 line:100%
-Calm down.
-Do you have any humanity at all?

00:11:45.240 --> 00:11:47.120 line:100%
-Xiaohe.
-You're the one who killed Uncle Ran!

00:11:47.200 --> 00:11:50.000 line:100%
You're a monster. A monster!

00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:53.760 line:100%
Xu Meng, you have lost your mind
and all humanity.

00:11:53.840 --> 00:11:54.840 line:100%
For your own selfish desires,

00:11:54.920 --> 00:11:56.640 line:100%
you've openly committed
numerous atrocities.

00:11:56.720 --> 00:11:58.680 line:100%
Your methods were cruel,
and your crimes heinous.

00:11:58.760 --> 00:12:01.480 line:100%
You've harmed so many people
and so many families.

00:12:01.560 --> 00:12:04.040 line:100%
You didn't even spare
the innocent Captain Ran or the child.

00:12:04.120 --> 00:12:06.880 line:100%
This is unconscionable. You are pure evil!

00:12:33.080 --> 00:12:34.000 line:100%
Where is it?

00:12:54.440 --> 00:12:57.360 line:100%
<i>No reason is an excuse to break the law.</i>

00:12:57.880 --> 00:13:00.680 line:100%
<i>No crime is ever truly foolproof.</i>

00:13:00.760 --> 00:13:02.240 line:100%
<i>Crime always leaves a trace.</i>

00:13:03.240 --> 00:13:06.400 line:100%
<i>No one escapes the long arm of the law.</i>

00:13:06.920 --> 00:13:10.960 line:100%
<i>Anyone who commits a crime</i>
<i>will be exposed to the law,</i>

00:13:11.040 --> 00:13:15.640 line:100%
<i>exposed to justice,</i>
<i>and exposed to the light of day.</i>

00:13:23.160 --> 00:13:26.040 line:100%
NEW YORK BLOCK

00:13:45.400 --> 00:13:46.440 line:100%
Xiaohe.

00:13:48.280 --> 00:13:49.240 line:100%
I'm sorry.

00:13:51.360 --> 00:13:53.520 line:100%
Please also tell Uncle He that I'm sorry.

00:13:55.480 --> 00:13:57.240 line:100%
Everything was my fault.

00:13:58.000 --> 00:13:59.600 line:100%
I brought this on myself.

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:02.000 line:100%
It's only natural

00:14:02.920 --> 00:14:04.360 line:100%
that you hate me.

00:14:05.360 --> 00:14:06.360 line:100%
Qiao Suqing,

00:14:07.600 --> 00:14:08.560 line:100%
I won't hate you.

00:14:09.640 --> 00:14:12.480 line:100%
The law will judge everything you've done.

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:16.800 line:100%
I will completely forget
the Qiao Suqing standing before me.

00:14:19.720 --> 00:14:22.680 line:100%
I will only remember that summer of 1997

00:14:24.160 --> 00:14:26.680 line:100%
and the Ms. Qiao who took care of me
all day and all night.

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:51.040 line:100%
Thank you.

00:15:07.400 --> 00:15:10.120 line:100%
<i>When their legal rights are violated,</i>

00:15:10.200 --> 00:15:12.480 line:100%
<i>the law is the only weapon</i>
<i>to protect oneself.</i>

00:15:13.560 --> 00:15:15.480 line:100%
<i>But in the June 30th case,</i>

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:18.360 line:100%
<i>the criminal suspect</i>
<i>represented by Xu Meng</i>

00:15:18.440 --> 00:15:22.640 line:100%
<i>did not choose the law after being harmed.</i>

00:15:22.720 --> 00:15:25.520 line:100%
<i>Instead, she vented her anger</i>
<i>through personal revenge.</i>

00:15:25.600 --> 00:15:28.280 line:100%
<i>One wrong step led to another,</i>
<i>and things escalated.</i>

00:15:29.480 --> 00:15:33.560 line:100%
<i>They kept crossing legal red lines</i>
<i>and challenging human decency,</i>

00:15:33.640 --> 00:15:36.000 line:100%
<i>becoming perpetrators through and through.</i>

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:39.000 line:100%
<i>On the path of crime,</i>
<i>they went further and further,</i>

00:15:39.520 --> 00:15:42.080 line:100%
<i>eventually sliding</i>
<i>into the abyss of no return.</i>

00:15:42.680 --> 00:15:45.280 line:100%
<i>They have to face</i>
<i>the judgment of law and justice.</i>

00:15:46.680 --> 00:15:49.080 line:20%
FEBRUARY 1, 2003

00:16:41.040 --> 00:16:42.760 line:100%
I didn't know Officer Ran,

00:16:43.760 --> 00:16:45.440 line:100%
but you said he was a good man.

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:50.200 line:100%
How could such a good person just be gone?

00:16:57.160 --> 00:16:59.040 line:100%
Did you just get off the train?

00:17:00.440 --> 00:17:01.360 line:100%
Yeah.

00:17:01.880 --> 00:17:02.760 line:100%
Why?

00:17:09.159 --> 00:17:10.480 line:100%
I'm going to wash my hands.

00:17:34.920 --> 00:17:37.440 line:100%
KUNHAI→WEIYANG, FEBRUARY 1, 2003

00:17:56.640 --> 00:17:57.600 line:100%
Sister,

00:17:58.840 --> 00:18:00.240 line:100%
do you still want to surrender?

00:18:06.880 --> 00:18:10.040 line:100%
If you still want to go, I'll go with you.

00:18:13.040 --> 00:18:16.320 line:100%
I know it might be
the wrong time to say this,

00:18:16.400 --> 00:18:17.960 line:100%
but I still want to say it.

00:18:18.840 --> 00:18:21.920 line:100%
Officer Ran's death might have been fate.

00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:24.800 line:100%
It's God giving you
a chance to choose again.

00:18:33.280 --> 00:18:34.600 line:100%
From now on,

00:18:36.320 --> 00:18:37.560 line:100%
no matter what I face,

00:18:43.440 --> 00:18:45.880 line:100%
I will choose to be a good person.

00:18:51.080 --> 00:18:53.840 line:100%
Sister, come home with me.

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:55.920 line:100%
It's only safe if you leave here.

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:01.360 line:100%
The home I wanted

00:19:05.120 --> 00:19:06.320 line:100%
is already gone.

00:19:07.120 --> 00:19:08.920 line:100%
The home you want doesn't matter.

00:19:10.440 --> 00:19:11.720 line:100%
Safety is what matters.

00:19:16.040 --> 00:19:17.080 line:100%
Meng,

00:19:19.360 --> 00:19:20.400 line:100%
you should go.

00:19:26.080 --> 00:19:28.840 line:100%
Aren't you afraid that staying
in Weiyang is dangerous?

00:19:33.920 --> 00:19:35.960 line:100%
I just want to stay in the sunlight.

00:19:42.880 --> 00:19:44.760 line:100%
Even if it's dangerous sunlight.

00:21:15.960 --> 00:21:17.760 line:100%
SIX MONTHS LATER, WEIYANG PEOPLE'S
PROCURATORATE FILED A PUBLIC PROSECUTION

00:21:17.840 --> 00:21:19.680 line:100%
DEFENDANT XU MENG IS SUSPECTED
OF ARSON, INTENTIONAL HOMICIDE

00:21:19.760 --> 00:21:22.080 line:100%
AND FALSE ACCUSATION
SENTENCING RECOMMENDATION: DEATH PENALTY

00:21:22.160 --> 00:21:24.480 line:100%
DEFENDANT QIAO SUQING IS SUSPECTED
OF INTENTIONAL HOMICIDE, HARBORING

00:21:24.560 --> 00:21:26.400 line:100%
AND FALSE ACCUSATION; SENTENCING
RECOMMENDATION: LIFE IMPRISONMENT

00:21:39.560 --> 00:21:42.160 line:20%
KIDDO

00:21:44.560 --> 00:21:46.800 line:100%
It's about time.

00:21:47.440 --> 00:21:49.000 line:100%
Why is there no news?

00:21:52.480 --> 00:21:53.480 line:20%
WECHAT: 1 CONTACT SENT A MESSAGE

00:21:59.720 --> 00:22:02.360 line:100%
<i>The sentencing just finished.</i>
<i>Xu got the death penalty.</i>

00:22:02.440 --> 00:22:03.840 line:100%
<i>Qiao got life.</i>

00:22:29.120 --> 00:22:30.040 line:100%
Hey, Meng.

00:22:30.560 --> 00:22:31.840 line:100%
Hurry up and get up.

00:22:31.920 --> 00:22:33.280 line:100%
Let's go for a walk downstairs.

00:22:33.360 --> 00:22:34.400 line:100%
No.

00:22:34.480 --> 00:22:36.520 line:100%
I'm going to practice "turtle breathing".

00:22:36.600 --> 00:22:37.800 line:100%
"Turtle breathing," my foot.

00:22:37.880 --> 00:22:40.320 line:100%
If you don't move around,
you'll be breathing your last soon!

00:22:40.400 --> 00:22:41.920 line:100%
I'm not going. I'm about to fall asleep.

00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:43.840 line:100%
Take a walk downstairs.

00:22:43.920 --> 00:22:45.040 line:100%
No, I'm not going.

00:22:45.120 --> 00:22:46.880 line:100%
-Let's go.
-No.

00:22:46.960 --> 00:22:48.080 line:100%
-I said I'm not going.
-Come on.

00:22:48.160 --> 00:22:50.160 line:100%
Help! Is anyone there?

00:22:50.240 --> 00:22:52.040 line:100%
Manager!

00:22:52.120 --> 00:22:53.760 line:100%
Come and change my room.

00:22:53.840 --> 00:22:56.520 line:100%
I can't stay in the same room
as this nutcase anymore!

00:22:56.600 --> 00:22:59.040 line:100%
-Shut up.
-Manager, where are you?

00:22:59.120 --> 00:23:00.720 line:100%
Help. Somebody!

00:23:00.800 --> 00:23:01.640 line:100%
Shut up.

00:23:01.720 --> 00:23:03.760 line:100%
Didn't you say you wanted
to see the square dance?

00:23:03.840 --> 00:23:05.200 line:100%
I'm taking you there,
and you're still unhappy?

00:23:07.800 --> 00:23:10.440 line:100%
COMMENDATION CEREMONY
FOR THE YUANLONGLI JUNE 30TH CASE

00:23:14.240 --> 00:23:15.200 line:100%
MERIT CITATION CLASS II

00:23:20.760 --> 00:23:21.640 line:20%
ZHAO JIE, ZOU WUHUANG

00:23:22.400 --> 00:23:23.360 line:100%
Ms. He Xiaohe,

00:23:23.440 --> 00:23:26.640 line:100%
on behalf of the veterans at the branch,
on my own behalf,

00:23:27.240 --> 00:23:29.200 line:100%
and on behalf of Captain Ran,
who died in the line of duty,

00:23:29.280 --> 00:23:30.360 line:100%
thank you.

00:23:41.480 --> 00:23:42.520 line:100%
Congratulations.

00:23:44.880 --> 00:23:45.920 line:20%
Thank you, Director Zou.

00:23:51.880 --> 00:23:53.520 line:20%
SECOND-CLASS MERIT MEDAL

00:23:56.400 --> 00:23:57.360 line:100%
Xiaohe,

00:23:58.600 --> 00:24:00.800 line:100%
you truly are the direct disciple
of my senior.

00:24:01.400 --> 00:24:02.440 line:100%
Starting off with a Second-Class Merit.

00:24:03.800 --> 00:24:06.160 line:100%
But you must never get arrogant.

00:24:06.240 --> 00:24:07.280 line:100%
You need to achieve more in the future.

00:24:07.360 --> 00:24:10.000 line:100%
Don't worry, Captain.
I will keep working hard.

00:24:11.280 --> 00:24:12.120 line:100%
There's also this.

00:24:12.720 --> 00:24:13.840 line:20%
What? There's another one?

00:24:13.920 --> 00:24:15.360 line:20%
This is for Mr. He.

00:24:15.440 --> 00:24:16.760 line:20%
An honorary certificate
for assisting in the investigation.

00:24:16.840 --> 00:24:18.680 line:100%
You will deliver it on our behalf.

00:24:21.840 --> 00:24:24.320 line:100%
Such an important honor,
how can it just be handed over?

00:24:25.040 --> 00:24:27.240 line:100%
The leadership isn't even
presenting it in person?

00:24:27.960 --> 00:24:30.400 line:100%
Is the leadership
getting too full of themselves?

00:24:35.440 --> 00:24:37.960 line:20%
Captain, I didn't say those words
just now.

00:24:38.040 --> 00:24:41.080 line:100%
I'm just a messenger for my dad.
Speaking for him in advance.

00:24:43.040 --> 00:24:45.000 line:100%
Yes. He's right.

00:24:45.080 --> 00:24:46.440 line:100%
How about this?

00:24:46.520 --> 00:24:48.720 line:100%
When the meeting is over,
I'll take the whole team

00:24:48.800 --> 00:24:50.680 line:100%
to pay Mr. He a visit in person
and give it to him.

00:24:50.760 --> 00:24:52.040 line:100%
Thank you, sir!

00:24:57.960 --> 00:24:58.920 line:100%
Wait.

00:25:03.280 --> 00:25:05.640 line:100%
This… Who is this supposed to be for?

00:25:06.520 --> 00:25:09.440 line:100%
Ms. He Xiaohe, effective immediately,

00:25:09.520 --> 00:25:11.520 line:100%
you are officially transferred
to criminal field operations.

00:25:12.040 --> 00:25:13.160 line:100%
In view of your outstanding performance,

00:25:13.240 --> 00:25:14.480 line:20%
the bureau has granted

00:25:15.000 --> 00:25:16.520 line:20%
you an opportunity
to change your badge number.

00:25:18.760 --> 00:25:19.920 line:100%
No need, Director Zou.

00:25:20.000 --> 00:25:21.360 line:100%
I'm fine using my own number.

00:25:21.960 --> 00:25:24.720 line:100%
Don't you want to see
the numbers you can choose from?

00:25:34.600 --> 00:25:36.600 line:20%
HE YUANHANG 813032

00:25:38.560 --> 00:25:42.040 line:20%
RAN FANGXU 813081

00:26:40.160 --> 00:26:41.000 line:20%
RAN FANGXU

00:26:41.080 --> 00:26:42.160 line:20%
Uncle Ran,

00:26:43.120 --> 00:26:44.840 line:20%
I have some good news for you.

00:26:45.440 --> 00:26:46.680 line:100%
The June 30th case is solved.

00:26:47.400 --> 00:26:49.760 line:100%
My dad and I followed the path
you took back then,

00:26:50.280 --> 00:26:51.520 line:100%
and we solved it completely.

00:26:52.640 --> 00:26:53.720 line:100%
From now on,

00:26:53.800 --> 00:26:55.680 line:100%
you don't have to worry
about this case anymore.

00:26:56.640 --> 00:26:57.800 line:100%
Oh, right.

00:26:58.840 --> 00:27:01.680 line:100%
Director Zou said
I could change to a new badge number.

00:27:02.840 --> 00:27:04.480 line:100%
He gave me two choices.

00:27:05.480 --> 00:27:06.520 line:100%
One was yours,

00:27:07.280 --> 00:27:08.360 line:100%
and the other was my dad's.

00:27:09.320 --> 00:27:10.200 line:20%
Uncle Ran,

00:27:10.720 --> 00:27:11.920 line:100%
I'm sorry.

00:27:13.040 --> 00:27:13.880 line:100%
I didn't choose yours.

00:27:15.480 --> 00:27:17.040 line:20%
But I didn't choose my dad's either.

00:27:17.640 --> 00:27:19.120 line:100%
I still want to use my own.

00:27:20.520 --> 00:27:23.600 line:100%
You'll support me, right?

00:27:35.160 --> 00:27:37.600 line:100%
Back then, everyone said
my song was old-fashioned.

00:27:38.400 --> 00:27:39.480 line:100%
Only you thought it sounded good.

00:27:40.240 --> 00:27:41.360 line:100%
You really have good taste.

00:27:42.320 --> 00:27:44.200 line:100%
This year, listen to it
one more time, okay?

00:27:44.280 --> 00:27:46.280 line:100%
If you still think it's good,

00:27:46.360 --> 00:27:47.440 line:100%
then listen to it a few more times.

00:27:48.160 --> 00:27:51.080 line:100%
If you think it's terrible,
please don't shake your head.

00:27:51.600 --> 00:27:52.800 line:100%
I'm afraid of getting scared.

00:28:11.200 --> 00:28:14.720 line:100%
<i>Freedom, freedom. It's burning</i>

00:28:14.800 --> 00:28:17.760 line:100%
<i>Close your eyes. Get some rest</i>

00:28:17.840 --> 00:28:20.200 line:100%
<i>The demolition under the spotlight</i>
<i>of the Yuanlongli community</i>

00:28:20.280 --> 00:28:21.520 line:100%
<i>is proceeding smoothly.</i>

00:28:21.600 --> 00:28:25.480 line:100%
<i>The building demolition work</i>
<i>will officially begin in 30 minutes.</i>

00:28:25.560 --> 00:28:28.280 line:100%
<i>Once a high-end community in Weiyang City,</i>

00:28:28.360 --> 00:28:29.760 line:100%
<i>it will now exit the stage of history</i>

00:28:29.840 --> 00:28:31.920 line:100%
<i>as the times continue to move forward.</i>

00:28:32.000 --> 00:28:34.360 line:100%
<i>Many urban legends have taken place here.</i>

00:28:34.440 --> 00:28:38.000 line:100%
<i>One wonders if they will fade into</i>
<i>the dust as this building disappears.</i>

00:28:38.080 --> 00:28:39.400 line:100%
<i>Let us wait and see.</i>

00:28:39.480 --> 00:28:41.880 line:20%
All checkpoints,
report your safety status.

00:28:42.920 --> 00:28:44.760 line:100%
Checkpoint One, clear.

00:28:45.720 --> 00:28:47.320 line:100%
Checkpoint Two, clear.

00:28:48.480 --> 00:28:50.160 line:100%
Checkpoint Three, clear.

00:28:51.160 --> 00:28:52.520 line:20%
Checkpoint Four, clear.

00:28:52.600 --> 00:28:53.440 line:20%
DEMOLITION IN PROGRESS. NO ENTRY

00:28:53.520 --> 00:28:55.080 line:20%
Checkpoint Five, clear.

00:28:56.000 --> 00:28:57.280 line:100%
Checkpoint Six, clear.

00:28:58.200 --> 00:28:59.600 line:100%
Checkpoint Seven, clear.

00:29:00.640 --> 00:29:02.040 line:20%
Checkpoint Eight, clear.

00:29:02.120 --> 00:29:03.080 line:20%
WEIYANG BLASTING SERVICES
POWERING YUANLONGLI'S DEMOLITION

00:29:03.680 --> 00:29:06.960 line:20%
All checkpoints are clear.
Requesting detonation.

00:29:07.040 --> 00:29:09.000 line:20%
Commencing one-minute countdown.

00:29:10.040 --> 00:29:11.160 line:100%
Officer He,

00:29:12.200 --> 00:29:13.240 line:100%
by coming here,

00:29:13.320 --> 00:29:16.720 line:100%
I can still see
my own house turning into rubble.

00:29:17.480 --> 00:29:18.760 line:100%
But what are you here for?

00:29:19.280 --> 00:29:21.720 line:100%
Don't tell me
you just came to hear the bang.

00:29:31.880 --> 00:29:33.400 line:100%
My judgment tells me
that the Yuanlongli case

00:29:33.480 --> 00:29:35.080 line:100%
isn't just a prank.

00:29:35.600 --> 00:29:37.760 line:100%
Because it's a prank. Understood?

00:29:37.840 --> 00:29:39.160 line:100%
It wasn't a prank at all.

00:29:39.240 --> 00:29:42.320 line:100%
They also said
the Xu Meng case was a prank.

00:29:42.400 --> 00:29:43.560 line:100%
What did you do?

00:29:43.640 --> 00:29:44.600 line:100%
What are you doing?

00:29:44.680 --> 00:29:46.400 line:100%
I'll look for evidence at Yuanlongli now.

00:29:46.480 --> 00:29:48.640 line:100%
Why do you keep going to Yuanlongli?

00:29:48.720 --> 00:29:50.640 line:100%
YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL GARDEN

00:29:56.600 --> 00:29:59.240 line:100%
This case has almost become a joke.

00:29:59.320 --> 00:30:00.760 line:100%
I can't go back empty-handed.

00:30:01.680 --> 00:30:02.960 line:100%
Stop!

00:30:05.680 --> 00:30:08.360 line:100%
Ran Fangxu, block him! Block him quickly!

00:30:16.080 --> 00:30:19.720 line:100%
He, I will do my best
to avoid delaying your return.

00:30:19.800 --> 00:30:23.400 line:100%
I will do my best
to avoid delaying your return.

00:30:24.440 --> 00:30:26.560 line:100%
He, are you giving up?

00:30:26.640 --> 00:30:29.440 line:100%
Are you telling me to give up?

00:30:29.520 --> 00:30:31.120 line:100%
How can you call this giving up?

00:30:31.200 --> 00:30:32.920 line:100%
I'm telling you to accept
your current pace

00:30:33.000 --> 00:30:34.560 line:100%
and you may continue to be useful.

00:30:34.640 --> 00:30:36.080 line:100%
That's just giving up.

00:30:36.160 --> 00:30:37.880 line:100%
That's just giving up.

00:30:37.960 --> 00:30:39.680 line:100%
<i>I want to give it one last shot</i>

00:30:40.200 --> 00:30:41.920 line:100%
and investigate Yuanlongli again.

00:30:55.920 --> 00:30:58.840 line:100%
<i>Why else do you think</i>
<i>I always visit Yuanlongli?</i>

00:30:58.920 --> 00:31:01.760 line:100%
<i>Because I know</i>
<i>it has the most important lead.</i>

00:31:01.840 --> 00:31:04.640 line:100%
As long as Yuanlongli is still here,
the case can be solved.

00:31:23.080 --> 00:31:25.640 line:20%
-Ten.
-Ten!

00:31:25.720 --> 00:31:27.680 line:20%
-Nine.
-Nine!

00:31:28.440 --> 00:31:29.960 line:100%
-Eight.
-Eight!

00:31:31.000 --> 00:31:32.320 line:20%
-Seven.
-Seven.

00:31:33.360 --> 00:31:34.520 line:100%
-Six.
-Six.

00:31:35.600 --> 00:31:36.840 line:100%
-Five.
-Five.

00:31:37.760 --> 00:31:38.720 line:100%
-Four.
-Four.

00:31:39.760 --> 00:31:40.880 line:100%
-Three.
-Three.

00:31:41.520 --> 00:31:42.440 line:100%
-Two.
-Two.

00:31:43.800 --> 00:31:45.600 line:20%
-One.
-Detonate.

00:32:17.520 --> 00:32:19.760 line:20%
DEMOLITION IN PROGRESS. NO ENTRY

00:32:39.640 --> 00:32:41.720 line:100%
Everything's been reduced to rubble.

00:32:42.880 --> 00:32:45.760 line:100%
Officer He, did you see that?

00:32:59.640 --> 00:33:03.240 line:100%
SENIOR WELLNESS AND CARE CENTER

00:33:10.480 --> 00:33:13.880 line:100%
Officers, who are you here to arrest?

00:33:13.960 --> 00:33:16.080 line:100%
Don't be nervous.
We're here to visit Mr. He Yuanhang.

00:33:16.600 --> 00:33:18.960 line:100%
SENIOR WELLNESS AND CARE CENTER

00:33:24.680 --> 00:33:27.080 line:100%
Mr. He, the comrades are here to see you.

00:33:36.040 --> 00:33:38.080 line:100%
Mr. He? Are you in the bathroom?

00:33:48.520 --> 00:33:50.560 line:100%
Sir, have you seen…

00:33:51.080 --> 00:33:53.400 line:100%
Sir, have you seen the person
who lives in this room,

00:33:53.480 --> 00:33:54.720 line:100%
someone named He Yuanhang?

00:33:54.800 --> 00:33:57.360 line:100%
Mr. He, comrades from the force
are here to see you.

00:34:01.440 --> 00:34:04.000 line:100%
Mr. He, are you okay?

00:34:12.640 --> 00:34:14.999 line:100%
Sir, we are looking for He Yuanhang.

00:34:15.080 --> 00:34:16.720 line:100%
Do you know where he went?

00:34:16.800 --> 00:34:18.479 line:100%
What do you want with He?

00:34:18.560 --> 00:34:19.999 line:100%
Meng, come out.

00:34:20.080 --> 00:34:22.240 line:100%
We're here to deliver
an award to He Yuanhang.

00:34:22.320 --> 00:34:23.600 line:100%
Where is he? Where did he go?

00:34:25.400 --> 00:34:26.640 line:100%
Delivering an award?

00:34:27.600 --> 00:34:29.400 line:100%
Well, in that case, you'll have to wait.

00:34:29.920 --> 00:34:31.760 line:100%
He went to the railway station
to see someone off.

00:34:38.519 --> 00:34:40.280 line:100%
The railway station? To see who off?

00:34:40.360 --> 00:34:42.120 line:100%
Oh no. Something's wrong.

00:34:57.720 --> 00:34:58.680 line:100%
Ran,

00:34:59.400 --> 00:35:00.920 line:100%
when you go back to Beijing this time,

00:35:01.000 --> 00:35:03.760 line:100%
just quit that teaching job.

00:35:04.360 --> 00:35:06.800 line:100%
Come back to the force.
We can be partners again.

00:35:08.560 --> 00:35:10.640 line:100%
Sir, that's a nice thought,

00:35:11.240 --> 00:35:12.640 line:100%
but it's procedurally impossible.

00:35:12.720 --> 00:35:13.880 line:100%
I can't return to the criminal department.

00:35:13.960 --> 00:35:15.360 line:100%
Why not?

00:35:15.440 --> 00:35:17.360 line:100%
Xu Zhihong's skull has been found.

00:35:17.440 --> 00:35:19.760 line:100%
We were both in charge
of this case back then.

00:35:19.840 --> 00:35:21.880 line:100%
If you come back,
we can keep investigating

00:35:21.960 --> 00:35:23.480 line:100%
and drag the killer out.

00:35:23.560 --> 00:35:25.960 line:100%
Sir, you're misremembering.

00:35:26.800 --> 00:35:29.040 line:100%
The June 30th case is already solved.

00:35:29.120 --> 00:35:30.440 line:100%
It's completely closed.

00:35:32.080 --> 00:35:33.000 line:100%
That's impossible.

00:35:33.520 --> 00:35:35.880 line:100%
If it were solved,
why would you be teaching in Beijing?

00:35:35.960 --> 00:35:37.560 line:100%
Stop trying to fool me.

00:35:38.440 --> 00:35:39.440 line:100%
Don't you remember?

00:35:40.160 --> 00:35:42.680 line:100%
In the end, this case was solved
by you and Xiaohe.

00:35:43.280 --> 00:35:45.200 line:100%
Everyone involved was brought to justice.

00:35:45.720 --> 00:35:47.360 line:100%
They all received
the sentence they deserved.

00:35:48.880 --> 00:35:50.680 line:100%
Actually, I should thank you both

00:35:51.400 --> 00:35:52.800 line:100%
for helping me fulfill a long-held wish.

00:35:56.640 --> 00:35:57.760 line:100%
No…

00:35:58.280 --> 00:35:59.360 line:100%
You must be lying to me.

00:35:59.440 --> 00:36:02.560 line:100%
Without you, just Xiaohe and me,

00:36:02.640 --> 00:36:04.160 line:100%
one old and one young,

00:36:04.240 --> 00:36:05.800 line:100%
how could we have solved
such a complex case?

00:36:08.400 --> 00:36:11.360 line:100%
Sir, everyone is here.

00:36:11.440 --> 00:36:12.440 line:100%
If you don't believe me, ask them.

00:36:17.920 --> 00:36:18.920 line:100%
Mr. He.

00:36:19.960 --> 00:36:23.000 line:100%
Are you all here to see Ran off?

00:36:25.240 --> 00:36:26.120 line:100%
Yes.

00:36:26.880 --> 00:36:29.000 line:100%
Fangxu, safe travels.

00:36:29.080 --> 00:36:31.200 line:100%
Once you're in Beijing,
don't forget about us.

00:36:31.280 --> 00:36:32.920 line:100%
Where are you looking?

00:36:33.000 --> 00:36:35.000 line:100%
He's right here.

00:36:38.080 --> 00:36:39.000 line:100%
Don't forget about us.

00:36:41.440 --> 00:36:42.360 line:100%
How could I?

00:36:43.560 --> 00:36:46.120 line:100%
Every one of you is in my heart.

00:36:48.000 --> 00:36:48.840 line:100%
Dad!

00:36:52.800 --> 00:36:55.200 line:100%
Xiaohe, Uncle Ran is leaving.

00:36:55.280 --> 00:36:57.040 line:100%
Hurry up and say goodbye.

00:37:00.240 --> 00:37:02.440 line:100%
Goodbye, Uncle Ran.

00:37:03.240 --> 00:37:05.120 line:100%
See? We're all doing quite well.

00:37:05.200 --> 00:37:06.640 line:100%
You can head back to Beijing in peace.

00:37:08.760 --> 00:37:10.880 line:100%
Don't worry. I'm at ease now.

00:37:12.160 --> 00:37:15.160 line:100%
Xiaohe, that uniform really suits you.

00:37:15.760 --> 00:37:18.160 line:100%
Keep it up. You'll be better than me.

00:37:23.520 --> 00:37:27.440 line:100%
<i>The Beijing-bound Train Z118</i>
<i>is about to depart.</i>

00:37:27.520 --> 00:37:29.080 line:100%
<i>Passengers, please board the train now.</i>

00:37:31.280 --> 00:37:33.280 line:100%
Sir, I should go.

00:37:37.720 --> 00:37:39.680 line:100%
Ran, go on then.

00:37:39.760 --> 00:37:40.920 line:100%
But we have a deal.

00:37:41.440 --> 00:37:43.200 line:100%
You cannot leave and never return.

00:37:43.960 --> 00:37:46.040 line:100%
From time to time,
you must come home and visit.

00:37:46.120 --> 00:37:48.560 line:100%
Otherwise, we will be worried about you.

00:37:48.640 --> 00:37:49.640 line:100%
Understand?

00:37:51.360 --> 00:37:52.200 line:100%
Okay.

00:37:59.280 --> 00:38:00.320 line:100%
Say something.

00:38:00.400 --> 00:38:01.800 line:100%
-Say…
-Right.

00:38:02.400 --> 00:38:03.880 line:100%
We miss you all the time.

00:38:03.960 --> 00:38:05.280 line:100%
We're always thinking about you.

00:38:06.480 --> 00:38:07.400 line:100%
Captain Ran,

00:38:07.920 --> 00:38:08.880 line:100%
I'm Zheng Zhong.

00:38:08.960 --> 00:38:10.200 line:100%
Even though you've never met me,

00:38:10.280 --> 00:38:12.200 line:100%
I can recite
all of your books from memory.

00:38:12.800 --> 00:38:15.480 line:100%
The theories in those books,
to this very day,

00:38:15.560 --> 00:38:16.600 line:100%
we are still using them.

00:38:21.400 --> 00:38:22.240 line:100%
You hear it?

00:38:22.320 --> 00:38:23.520 line:100%
I hear you.

00:38:24.760 --> 00:38:25.800 line:100%
I hear all of you.

00:38:27.880 --> 00:38:29.480 line:100%
Thank you for still
keeping me in your thoughts.

00:38:30.120 --> 00:38:32.440 line:100%
And I wish you success in your work

00:38:34.200 --> 00:38:35.080 line:100%
and good health.

00:38:37.600 --> 00:38:38.560 line:100%
I'm going now.

00:38:48.600 --> 00:38:49.560 line:100%
Sir,

00:38:51.280 --> 00:38:52.120 line:100%
I'm leaving.

00:40:12.760 --> 00:40:15.360 line:100%
Ran Fangxu has truly left this time!

00:40:15.880 --> 00:40:18.040 line:100%
Take care of yourselves.

00:40:38.400 --> 00:40:40.320 line:100%
I really do miss Captain Ran.

00:40:45.040 --> 00:40:46.200 line:100%
I always have.

00:40:48.280 --> 00:40:51.000 line:100%
Don't worry, Uncle Ran.

00:40:52.720 --> 00:40:53.800 line:100%
I will carry it on.

00:40:55.920 --> 00:40:57.120 line:100%
We'll carry it all on.

00:40:58.720 --> 00:41:00.720 line:100%
Goodbye!

00:42:24.120 --> 00:42:30.240 line:100%
THE END